  "sourceTitle": "Layered Taco Dip",
  "sourceText": "Layered Taco Dip\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, December 24, 2009 - 11:41pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n16 ounces Sour Cream\n1 pound Ground Beef\n1 pkt Taco Seasoning\n1/2 small head Lettuce, shredded\n1 medium Green pepper, chopped\n1 medium Onion, chopped fine\n2 mediums Tomatoes, chopped\n8 ounces Cheese, Chedder, Shredded\n1/2 cup Black olives, drained, chopped\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Brown ground beef and season with package of taco seasoning; drain. On a large 18\" or 20\" platter, layer ingredients in order. 2 Serve cold with crackers and tortilla chips.",
